# Next.js web

- App Router under `app/`. Build and dev use the Next.js CLI (`next build`, `next dev`), run from the repo root with `vp run`.
- Compiler versions are in `docs/adr/001-vite-plus-vs-nx.md`.
- Workspace packages are dependencies with the `workspace:*` protocol. They publish built JavaScript, so Next does not transpile them.
- Do not add a package-local ESLint, Biome, or Prettier config. Lint and format come from the root `vite.config.ts`.
